# What NOT to upload to Cloud Build.
#
# gcloud falls back to honouring .gitignore when this file is absent, but relying on that to
# keep a live API key out of a build context is not a risk worth taking. .env is named here
# explicitly.

.env
.env.*
!.env.example

.git
.github
node_modules
dist

# Research and process material — not needed to run the app.
specs
docs
evals
tests
.antigravity
*.md
!README.md
